    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but \"surviving the ashes\" sounds so exhausting. it's not even about being strong anymore, it just feels like watching a beautiful painting get slowly covered in mud. and the mud is winning. it feels like there's no dignity in just sitting here waiting for the inevitable. i just feel so heavy... like the world is moving toward a dark ending and i'm being forced to stay awake for every second of the misery.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
