      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When the weight feels unbearable, please do not stay up alone; reach out to a crisis counselor right now so someone can hold space for your exhaustion instead of you carrying it by yourself. Your perspective is not the only truth, and someone actually cares enough to listen without needing you to be strong. You deserve to feel light, but only by leaning on hands that are ready to catch you, not by fighting a war you are sure you cannot win.",
