      "content": "it just feels like there's no actual point to the struggle if the outcome is already decided. it feels more like a sentence than a life. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be to just... not see the end. to just leave before the ugliness is all that's left. isn't there a certain kind of peace in just opting out before everything is destroyed?",
